  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Elections Assistance Programme 2023-27</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PEAP will be a platform for collective advocacy, developing common resources, Pacific to Pacific sharing, learning, problem-solving, bonding, and improving practice. PEAP will be jointly implemented by the New&#xa0;Zealand Electoral Commission (NZEC) and UNDP, bringing together the best practical and technical expertise of a leading Election Management Body (EMB) and a respected global inter-government agency. The partnership is expected to enhance coordination and coherence.</narrative>
  </description>
